{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCHOOL EXIT CLASS 8</strong> is a first-person anomaly-spotting horror game in the style of <i>Exit 8</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you'll explore looping hallways, classrooms, restrooms, and the infirmary inside a mysterious school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the anomalies\u2014if something feels off, turn back. That\u2019s the only rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A selection of the 51 total anomalies from the full game is available in this preview.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be the one to find the exit\u2026 or will someone else inside you get there first?<br><br>About This Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the beginning of the full game.<br>Explore the eerie school hallways, identify &quot;anomalies,&quot; and turn back when something feels wrong.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Number of anomalies included: <strong>5</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core gameplay loop is playable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime: 10\u201315 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Differences from the Full Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can experience 5 anomalies, while the full version features over 50 anomalies waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo does not include any endings, but the full version features multiple endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893570?t=1753556838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893570/9d2d92ffe249e1214b489d6d4114b2cb702f2330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753556838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893570/c0b3a2c91aca5adee670e0c12c815c1978aebce8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753556838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a